# The postmaster: `check`, sending a letter through the line editor, and the
# recipient collecting it at the other end.
#
# Four connections, because a script is one connection and this needs two
# characters. The first character created on an empty roster is an
# implementor (db.c's "if this is our first player --- he be God"), so the
# god is made first and the mortal who gets the letter second.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
quit
!reconnect
Paritytwo
y
swordfish
swordfish
f
c

1
quit
!reconnect
# The god, at the Post Office, with the price of a stamp.
Parityone
swordfish

1
set Parityone gold 5000
goto 3062
look
check
mail Paritytwo
A letter typed by the parity harness.
It is two lines long, like the board message.
/s
check
# Somebody who has never existed.
mail Nobodyhere
receive
quit
!reconnect
# The mortal, who has to walk: south, east, north from the temple is the
# Post Office. `goto` is an immortal command and this character is a level 1
# cleric.
Paritytwo
swordfish

1
check
south
east
north
look
check
receive
inventory
read letter
check
receive
quit
